OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTurning
OL,6,Fincreasingly wet and windy overnight
OL,7,Fwith the heaviest rain in the north
OL,8,Fand west. Occasionally damp in the
OL,9,Fsouth but generally drier here.
OL,10,FBecoming quite chilly under clear
OL,11,Fskies at first but turning very mild
OL,12,Fthrough the early hours.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FA windy day with gales on
OL,15,Fcoasts and more widely over northern
OL,16,Fhills at first. Spells of rain
OL,17,Fclearing south with cooler, sunnier
OL,18,Fweather and showers following from the
OL,19,Fnorth.
